[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0589","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0589.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0780","title":"Ipswitch IMail 目录遍历漏洞","description":"Ipswitch IMail 6.04 及更早版本的 Web 服务器存在目录遍历漏洞，远程攻击者可通过在 URL 中构造 `../`（点点斜杠）序列绕过路径限制，实现对服务器上任意文件的读取和删除操作。该漏洞源于程序未对用户提交的文件路径进行充分的规范化过滤，攻击者无需身份认证即可利用，影响邮件服务器数据机密性和完整性。Exploit-DB 已公开该漏洞的利用代码。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.4,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0780"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:27.943","remediation":"立即升级 Ipswitch IMail 至 6.05 或更高版本，该版本已修复 Web 服务器对 `../` 路径序列的过滤缺陷。如无法升级，在 Web 服务器配置中禁用目录遍历功能，限制 Web 服务仅访问特定目录，并部署 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）拦截包含 `..` 的 URL 请求作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=96767207207553&w=2","http://www.ipswitch.com/Support/IMail/news.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1617","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20182","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e1fee15e021f95477107e3e5d652470f76f7bac/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0780.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0780","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0780.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d449633638bc4d33beb359a70dee0dbe66d39a20/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0780.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ece131eb82ceb38a160571408bcbbb92bfa0f3c0/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-mxx4-32g7-frv8/GHSA-mxx4-32g7-frv8.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0780.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_3.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b