理层限制 HTTP GET 请求长度（如 nginx 的 large_client_header_buffers 设置为 4k），并在防火墙仅允许可信 IP 访问该服务端口以缩小攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0118.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1568","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5113","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20148","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/27eee309d10a00ce5571c5ab1765599e23f1725f/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0776.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0776","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0776.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d449633638bc4d33beb359a70dee0dbe66d39a20/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0776.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/b21976b5bf1b11783559cbe4f375f11636b79518/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-fm7f-2pvq-7cvg/GHSA-fm7f-2pvq-7cvg.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0776.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152700_152800.json","https://github.com/akabe1/windows_exploit_dowser/blob/11b24e36173cd382721db28581e575faf687d06b/cve_from_exploitdb_website.csv","https://github.com/notvelleda/uclinux-mac-plus/blob/a937136a2f40ac87410f821dcf3204cd75b1a014/uClinux/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/mediahouse_statistics_web_server.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0585.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0585.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-058