0212.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0294.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/freebsd/2000-08/0340.html","http://www.debian.org/security/2000/20000816","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1585","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=20000815231724.A14694%40subterrain.net","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20154","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/60bbc98c39201e6f5661b9e41f1492ce39335948/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0763.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0763","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0763.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f0111a41156462d46f484c055bdeafa69cf38c8e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0763.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-8w62-g849-p4ww/GHSA-8w62-g849-p4ww.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0763.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_5.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--19d2120f-1cda-4ea1-b4b3-a280955f66f7.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0581.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0577","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0577.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0757","title":"Aptis Software TotalBill 3.0 sysgen服务 远程命令执行漏洞","description":"Aptis Software TotalBill 3.0 的 sysgen 服务未实施任何身份认证机制，远程攻击者可直接连接该服务并指定要执行的系统命令，导致攻击者能够以 root 权限在目标服务器上执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 TotalBill 3.0 版本，攻击无需任何认证，利用复杂度低，可完全控制服务器系统，危害严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0757"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:25.063","remediation":"立即在防火墙层面阻断对 TCP 端口 9998（sysgen 服务）的外部访问，仅允许受信任的管理 IP 连接。如业务不需要该服务，直接停用 sysgen 进程并从启动脚本中移除。由于 Aptis TotalBill 3.0 已停止维护，无法通过升级修复，建议迁移至替代计费系统。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0074.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1555","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20145","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/528991f6906b29893dd0e43e65862cd92fd607c8/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0757.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0757","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0757.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f2c577e1255b2c3fd617b7f1c499a222feb7b668/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0757.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-xxmv-v72m-r6w4/GHSA-xxmv-v72m-r6w4.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1555/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0757.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_3.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--46e4f820-58ec-48e2-a1c8-bb7a71b49cca.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0577.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0576","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0576.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0751","title":"HP-UX mopd 格式化字符串远程代码执行漏洞","description":"mopd（Maintenance Operations Protocol loader daemon，维护操作协议加载守护进程）存在格式化字符串注入漏洞，由于未能正确过滤用户输入的格式化字符串，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向目标系统发送特制的格式化字符串载荷，触发该漏洞后可在目标系统上执行任意命令。该漏洞影响运行 mopd 服务的系统，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0751"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:24.320","remediation":"升级 mopd（Maintenance Operations Protocol loader daemon）至已修复格式串处理缺陷的最新版本，或应用厂商提供的安全补丁。如无法立即升级，在防火墙层面限制对 mopd 服务端口（通常为 UDP 1509）的远程访问，仅允许可信 IP 段连接，同时禁用不必要的网络服务以减少攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0064.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/freebsd/2000-08/0336.html","http://cvsweb.netbsd.org/bsdweb.cgi/basesrc/usr.sbin/mopd/mopd/process.c.diff?r1=1.7&r2=1.8&f=h","http://www.openbsd.org/errata.html#mopd","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-050.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1559","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/26630","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/377bb49f7479dd297ab5004f75a37c291a136578/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0751.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0751","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0751.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f2c577e1255b2c3fd617b7f1c499a222feb7b668/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0751.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/db909d46c3d9b98ec1f95daa3c88d7a8990ea8f5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-3jc7-m4hm-g848/GHSA-3jc7-m4hm-g848.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152700_152800.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_4.list.dict","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0751.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/7e9d0f9f6e96f881defceb153c169913a330643d/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0576.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0575","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0575.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0745","title":"PHP-Nuke PHP-Nuke 管理员身份验证绕过漏洞","description":"PHP-Nuke 1.0 及 2.5 版本中 admin.php3 管理脚本存在身份验证绕过漏洞。由于该脚本在处理管理员登录请求时未能正确验证密码参数，远程攻击者无需提供有效的管理员用户名（aid）或密码（pwd）参数，仅通过直接访问特定的管理员 URL 即可绕过身份认证机制，获得网站后台管理权限。利用该漏洞，攻击者可完全控制目标网站，执行任意管理操作，包括修改网站内容、上传恶意文件等。攻击条件简单，无需任何前置权限，危害严重。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0745"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:23.560","remediation":"PHP-Nuke 1.0/2.5 已停止维护且不再发布安全更新，建议立即迁移至受支持的 CMS 平台（如 WordPress、Joomla）。临时缓解措施：在 admin.php3 开头添加会话认证检查，确保未登录用户直接访问时返回 403；或通过 Web 服务器配置（如 .htaccess 或 Nginx location 规则）限制 admin.php3 仅允许特定 IP 访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0243.html","http://www.osvdb.org/1521","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1592","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20158","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7d4778b18ea29de57c8a889212050a9d38e2d2cb/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0745.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0745","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0745.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1b84eedba993546f37a880c6d2d084176a1f04a7/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0745.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1684cfa32e43376c48beb06819bce86de6ba421b/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-mjjf-5gp4-m9fg/GHSA-mjjf-5gp4-m9fg.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/php_nuke_installed.nasl","https://github.com/sullo/advisory-archives/blob/55a0a276cd72a43d289a528109c4807a025b693d/RFP2101.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0745.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0575.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0572","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0572.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0743","title":"明尼苏达大学 Gopherd 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"明尼苏达大学（UMN）Gopherd 2.x 的 Halidate 函数存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向目标系统发送特制的 DES 密钥生成请求（GDESkey），其中包含超长的 ticket 值，从而触发缓冲区溢出，导致任意代码执行。CVSS 评分 10.0，攻击复杂度低，无需交互即可完全控制目标系统，机密性、完整性和可用性均受到严重影响。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0743"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:23.430","remediation":"立即在 gopherd 源码目录执行 ./configure --disable-auth 禁用认证功能后重新编译部署，或升级到 UMN 官方发布的补丁版本。由于 Gopher 协议已淘汰且官方不再维护，建议将服务迁移至 HTTP/HTTPS 协议并彻底停用 gopherd 进程，同时在防火墙禁用 TCP 端口 70 以防止外部访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-