igital Security IRIS 1.01 beta 网络抓包分析工具存在拒绝服务漏洞，由于该软件在处理 UDP 连接时缺乏有效的连接数限制机制，远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送大量 UDP 连接请求，导致 IRIS 软件资源耗尽，无法正常执行网络数据包捕获与分析功能。该漏洞影响 eEye IRIS 1.01 beta 版本，攻击者无需认证即可远程触发，对网络监控和安全分析环境构成威胁。建议用户升级至修复后的版本或部署访问控制策略限制 UDP 流量。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0734"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:22.280","remediation":"升级 eEye IRIS 至 1.02 或更高版本，该版本已修复对大量 UDP 连接处理不当导致的拒绝服务问题。在网络边界防火墙上限制对 IRIS 管理端口的非授权访问，并部署入侵检测规则对异常 UDP 流量进行告警和限速。如产品已停止维护，建议迁移至其他主流网络入侵检测系统。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=96774637326591&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1627","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20184","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9342e5394ee109ffc3617b5105797cdfcfcb78cf/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0734.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0734","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0734.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4591185d8ea1fe47b6e30df3286bd52753a931ce/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0734.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1684cfa32e43376c48beb06819bce86de6ba421b/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-jxxq-gmfj-7r8f/GHSA-jxxq-gmfj-7r8f.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0734.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152700_152800.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_2.list.dict","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/f3526cd689b486e2ddce9b934197355bd7bbd3ae/2000.tsv